[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:00.16]I have always been here
[00:00.16]我始终立于此处
[00:11.65]I have always looked out from behind these eyes
[00:11.65]我始终警惕着无数目光背后的阴谋
[00:21.94]It feels like more than a lifetime
[00:21.94]似乎比一生还要漫长
[00:26.67]Feels like more than a lifetime
[00:26.67]似乎比一生还要漫长
[00:38.11]Sometimes I get tired of the waiting
[00:38.11]有时我只是厌倦了等待
[00:47.69]Sometimes I get tired of being in here
[00:47.69]有时我只是厌倦了继续在此处逗留
[00:57.20]Is this the way it has always been
[00:57.20]这就是唯一的出路吗
[01:03.52]Could it ever have been different
[01:03.52]是否会有迎来转机的一天
[01:12.41]Do you ever get tired of the waiting
